OL,5,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FMatt Adams rides a volatile load
OL,7,     Finto a world of trouble with a
OL,8,     Fbull on board, the Kendalls share
OL,9,     Fa family experience of trucking,
OL,10,     Fand another haul carries a sting.
OL,11,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,12,     FIn Berkshire, a convoy of three
OL,13,     Ftrucks pick up and deliver a fleet
OL,14,     Fof 15 valuable supercars, ensuring
OL,15,     Fthey arrive in precisely the same
OL,16,     Fpristine condition as when they
OL,17,     Fwere loaded.
